From 5a0c7bee03a70fa342b584fbaecbb6f56a164db9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: flappy-snapshot <snapshot@local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:44:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Working Flappy Bird: direct game start, in-place restart,
 Microchip logo sprite

- Boots straight into Flappy Bird (skips 4-screen demo cycle)
- SW2 restarts game in place after game over (no screen reload, avoids timer race)
- Player sprite is the Microchip logo (RGB565, rounded corners)
- SRAM region bumped 1MB to 2MB in app.overlay for lv_image widget
- hss-payload.yaml ELF path fixed for local user
---
 demos/pic64_smp_hello/CMakeLists.txt          |   1 +
 demos/pic64_smp_hello/app.overlay             |   2 +-
 demos/pic64_smp_hello/hss-payload.yaml        |   2 +-
 demos/pic64_smp_hello/src/demo_manager.c      |  12 +-
 .../pic64_smp_hello/src/microchip_logo_img.c  | 266 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../pic64_smp_hello/src/microchip_logo_img.h  |   6 +
 demos/pic64_smp_hello/src/screen_game.c       |  45 ++-
 7 files changed, 301 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 demos/pic64_smp_hello/src/microchip_logo_img.c
 create mode 100644 demos/pic64_smp_hello/src/microchip_logo_img.h

